'''Gaia the Creator''' is a [[:Category:Legend Rare Cats|Legend Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked at an extremely low chance when playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during [[The Almighties The Majestic Zeus (Gacha Event)|The Almighties The Majestic Zeus]] gacha event. She was added in [[Version 8.7 Update|Version 8.7]].

