==Trivia==
*[[wikipedia:Gaia|Gaia]] is a Greek primordial goddess who is the personification of earth itself. The Olympian gods are her descendants.
*In-game, Gaia the Creator's Evolved Form name is printed as "Gaia the Supreme ", with an extra space erroneously placed at the end. This is most easily seen in the Cat Guide menu.
*Gaia the Creator's descriptions reference the ''[[wikipedia:Mana (series)|Mana]]'' series of RPGs. In the games, it is said that everything in the world comes from [[wikia:Mana:Mana (element)|Mana]], an element derived from the [[wikia:Mana:Tree of Mana|Tree of Mana]], whose avatar is a [[wikia:Mana:Mana Goddess|powerful goddess]].

